@ScriptbloxTermedMe yeah you can just add some simple closing logic to it, like what i did was make a key system that grabs/fetch the key from this site: https://roblox-key-system-production.up.railway.app/

once the right key’s entered, it just deletes the gui and runs the main script with loadstring.

i only shared the gui part since theres a bunch of ways to do key systems, so figured its better to let people set it up how they want
